  "user": "I'm CUS-0004. Transaction TX-0401, 240.00 EUR: the goods never arrived. Which reason code applies?",
  "answer": "**goods_not_received** is the reason code that applies to TX-0401.\n\nI checked TX-0401 (240.00 EUR, TechMart Online, 20 July 2026, settled) against that code:\n- **Eligible:** yes\n- **Window:** 90 days from the transaction date\n- **Deadline:** 18 October 2026\n\nI haven't opened a dispute yet, since that action can't be reversed. Should I open it now under goods_not_received for the full 240.00 EUR?\n\nI also see a second 240.00 EUR charge from TechMart Online on 14 July 2026 (TX-0402). If that one was a duplicate charge rather than a separate order, let me know. A duplicate charge would be disputed under a different code, and I can check its eligibility too.",
